OL,3,GNEWSAModel boats banned from lake over
OL,4,Aspeed fears
OL,5,
OL,6,FPeople with model boats have been
OL,7,Fbanned from using a park's lake, unless
OL,8,Fthey are taking part in a session run
OL,9,Fby a local boat club.
OL,11,FStevenage Borough Council said the sign
OL,12,Fwas erected at Fairlands Valley Park to
OL,13,Fstop people outside of the club from
OL,14,F"using high-powered model boats" on
OL,15,FMillennium Lake.
OL,17,FIan Searle, secretary of Stevenage
OL,18,FModel Boat Club, said there were model
OL,19,Fboats you can buy off the shelf that
OL,20,Ftravel at speeds of 60-70mph (up to
OL,21,F112km/h).
OL,23,APub: 05-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
