OL,3,GNEWSAModel boats banned from lake over
OL,4,Aspeed fears
OL,5,
OL,6,F"Those without experience, who are
OL,7,Fgenerally not insured, can try them out
OL,8,Fon the lake which is likely to cause an
OL,9,Faccident," he said.
